        "@value": "by substituting for the word “three” the word “seven”;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/15/eng@/~cl_15__para_b__subpara_ii",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "ii",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/15/eng@/~cl_15__para_b",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by deleting the words “or the period specified in section 20 whichever be the longer”; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/15/eng@/~cl_15__para_b__subpara_iii",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "iii",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/15/eng@/~cl_15__para_b",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by substituting for the words “subject to such conditions” the words “subject to such fees and conditions”; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/15/eng@/~cl_15__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/15/eng@/~cl_15",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after the renumbered subsection (1) the following subsection: “(2) The Registrar-General may waive, in whole or in part, the fees prescribed for late registration referred to in subsection (1) subject to such criteria and conditions as the Minister may determine.”. Amendment of section 22"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/15/eng@/~cl_16",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "16",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/15/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Subsection 22(1) of the principal Act is amended by substituting for the words “twelve hours” the words “seven days”. Amendment of section 23"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/15/eng@/~cl_17",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "17",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/15/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 23 of the principal Act is amended by substituting for the words “twenty-four hours” the words “seven days”. Amendment of section 24"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/15/eng@/~cl_18",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "18",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/15/eng@/~cl_18__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/15/eng@/~cl_18__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/15/eng@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 24 of the principal Act is amended—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/15/eng@/~cl_18__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/15/eng@/~cl_18",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by substituting for the words “twenty-four hours” the words “seven days”; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/15/eng@/~cl_18__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/15/eng@/~cl_18",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by deleting the words “for the registration area within which the death took place or the body of such person was found”. New sections 24a and 24b"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/15/eng@/~cl_19",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "19",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/15/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The principal Act is amended by inserting after section 24 the following sections: “Registration of presumed death 24a. (1) When an order from a Court has been granted pertaining to a missing person’s presumed death under any written law, the person who has been granted the order may forward the order to the Registrar for the purpose of registering the particulars of the missing person’s presumed death. (2) On receipt of the order under subsection (1), the Registrar shall make an entry in a register containing the name of the missing person and such other information as may be necessary in relation to the missing person’s presumed death. Certificate of Presumed Death 24b. The Registrar, upon registering a missing person’s presumed death, shall issue a Certificate of Presumed Death to the person forwarding the Court order under section 24a.”. Amendment of section 26"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/15/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/15/eng@/~cl_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "This Act may be cited as the Births and Deaths Registration (Amendment) Act 2016."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/15/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/15/eng@/~cl_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "This Act comes into operation on a date to be appointed by the Minister by notification in the Gazette. Amendment of section 2"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/15/eng@/~cl_2",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/15/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Births and Deaths Registration Act 1957 [Act 299], which is referred to as the “principal Act” in this Act, is amended in section 2 by inserting after the definition of “Certificate of Death” the following definition: ‘ “Certificate of Presumed Death” means a certificate issued pursuant to section 24b or subsection 32(1);’. Amendment of section 4"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/15/eng@/~cl_20",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "20",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/15/eng@/~cl_20__para_a",
