      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/15/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The principal Act is amended by inserting after section 10 the following section: “Special provision as to registration of birth 10a. Notwithstanding the provisions of this Part, the Registrar-General may, if he is satisfied from evidence adduced before him that a birth had occurred, cause such birth to be registered by entering in a register such particulars concerning the birth.”. Deletion of section 11"
